eyes MD\" is a controlled medical device (generic name: program for general-purpose diagnostic imaging workstations, certification number: 302ADBZX00011000) under the \"Act on Quality, Efficacy and Safety Assurance of Pharmaceuticals, Medical Devices, etc.\" (Pharmaceuticals and Medical Devices Act)."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "md_logo.png", "id": "5998065973633964", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003260_5998065976967297_260827317627691552_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=m5jeVuYQMD4Q7kNvwEKTNGc&_nc_oc=AdonWYmystjquqJ_AaR0-sxUgN9-dviYQkbiBrcwiQ1ojepy8f6ISOSrhKl_0pi9w9I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0epRqRsuJ69JX-1zStGqqY-X2nJgYaPzxbX8ovvmTmww&oe=69F0A74D"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_tate.png", "id": "2303415159832893", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974904_2303415163166226_7688600240374808365_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Z9RhQ_0QSrgQ7kNvwF4tuhD&_nc_oc=Adp9a-jaxQq9dRkjmAOO5PWNvRhDBHwnYDwl0hHsoiVE1EbZA0x1lp0YobZDGAoroNE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0ptxmy234AYjqPHD2ru4-s34VdZ0PKasOsAZDnNH-6PQ&oe=69F0D1EC"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_miniyoko.png", "id": "950325029433473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031585_950325032766806_6345836855774372629_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=L-ikJBBIPFYQ7kNvwEGbxLX&_nc_oc=Adr4Q1PHR6Quij1faRiayf8mwS4C-gR-n83aqeihvrK0xaFiQ7YDuxQDsS_ivDFwU40&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1nvZBWA-HZJS4DLZ0D6AjAzBzqsacCQfD0Ld7HPTPZSg&oe=69F0BB3D"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_yoko.png", "id": "773168277532939", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75223486_773168280866272_6988374572968566012_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zCBjxjZP5cwQ7